@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 文件下载时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件列表页\n(files/List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as FileCtrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as FileSvc
database "FileRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

User -> UI: 点击“下载”
UI -> Axios: GET /api/files/download/{fileId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\nresponseType=blob
Axios -> FileCtrl: downloadFile(fileId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContextHolder: 获取 username/userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: getFilePath(fileId, userId)
FileSvc -> DB: 校验归属、未删除
alt 不存在/无权限
  FileSvc --> FileCtrl: 抛出错误
  FileCtrl --> Axios: 404/500
  Axios --> UI: 显示错误
  return
end
FileSvc -> DB: getFile(fileId, userId)
FileSvc -> FileSvc: downloadCount+1 并保存
FileSvc --> FileCtrl: 物理路径 Path
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 二进制流\nContent-Type: contentType\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename
Axios --> UI: 创建 Blob 并触发保存

note over FileCtrl
接口：GET /api/files/download/{fileId}
end note

@enduml

